pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: tree-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 30, 832, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      letterSpacing: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: ISSUE TREE · MARKET ENTRY
  - elementId: tree-root
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 54, 832, 54]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.25
      align: [left, top]
      text: Should we enter market X directly, through a distribution partner, or not at all?
  - elementId: tree-stem
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [478, 116, 2, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: tree-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [236, 144, 486, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: tree-drop-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [236, 146, 2, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: tree-drop-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [478, 146, 2, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: tree-drop-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [720, 146, 2, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: branch-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [144, 180, 220, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 1 · Market attractiveness
  - elementId: branch-1-items
    elementType: text
    bounds: [144, 212, 220, 110]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Size and growth, 2024–2029</p>
        <p>Customer concentration</p>
        <p>Regulatory entry barriers</p>
  - elementId: branch-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [386, 180, 220, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 2 · Capability fit
  - elementId: branch-2-items
    elementType: text
    bounds: [386, 212, 220, 110]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Channel access and brand</p>
        <p>Local service capability</p>
        <p>Product localization effort</p>
  - elementId: branch-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [628, 180, 240, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 3 · Economics and risk
  - elementId: branch-3-items
    elementType: text
    bounds: [628, 212, 240, 110]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Payback and capital at risk</p>
        <p>Partner economics and control</p>
        <p>Exit and reversal cost</p>
  - elementId: decisive-mark
    elementType: text
    bounds: [628, 326, 240, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: 1
      align: [left, middle]
      text: DECISIVE BRANCH
  - elementId: tree-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 382, 832, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>MECE check:</strong> attractiveness, fit, and economics are independent; each branch has one owner and one exhibit.</p>
        <p><strong>Already answered:</strong> branch 1 (Exhibit 1); branch 2 is open; branch 3 decides the recommendation.</p>
  - elementId: tree-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 500, 832, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "Source: project interviews (n = 14), client data room (May 2026), and public filings; details in appendix C."
